    "evacuationRoute": "Primary Route: Exit the safety office and go down the stairs to the first floor. Turn right, walk down the hall and exit through the first available door that leads outside. \n\nSecondary Exit: Exit the safety office, turn towards the left and follow the hallway all the way around to the JAG office. Walk down the stairs, exit through the first available door that leads outside. \n\nThe assembly area will be in the parking lot near the flag pole. ",
